   "P1",
   "Title: Equivalence of Definitions of Matroid Rank Axioms/Formulation 2 Implies Formulation 1"
  ],
  [
   "P2",
   "Let $S$ be a [[Definition:Finite Set|finite set]]."
  ],
  [
   "P3",
   "Let $\\rho : \\powerset S \\to \\Z$ be a [[Definition:Mapping|mapping]] from the [[Definition:Power Set|power set]] of $S$ to the [[Definition:Integer|integers]]."
  ],
  [
   "P4",
   "Let $\\rho$ satisfy [[Axiom:Rank Axioms (Matroid)/Definition 2|formulation 2]] of the [[Axiom:Rank Axioms (Matroid)|rank axioms]]:"
  ],
  [
   "P5",
   "{{begin-axiom}}"
  ],
  [
   "P6",
   "{{axiom | n = \\text R 4"
  ],
  [
   "P7",
   "        | q = \\forall X \\in \\powerset S"
  ],
  [
   "P8",
   "        | mr = 0 \\le \\map \\rho X \\le \\size X"
  ],
  [
   "P9",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P10",
   "{{axiom | n = \\text R 5"
  ],
  [
   "P11",
   "        | q = \\forall X, Y \\in \\powerset S"
  ],
  [
   "P12",
   "        | mr = X \\subseteq Y \\implies \\map \\rho X \\le \\map \\rho Y"
  ],
  [
   "P13",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P14",
   "{{axiom | n = \\text R 6"
  ],
  [
   "P15",
   "        | q = \\forall X, Y \\in \\powerset S"
  ],
  [
   "P16",
   "        | mr = \\map \\rho {X \\cup Y} + \\map \\rho {X \\cap Y} \\le \\map \\rho X + \\map \\rho Y"
  ],
  [
   "P17",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P18",
   "{{end-axiom}}"
  ],
  [
   "P19",
   "Then $\\rho$ satisfies [[Axiom:Rank Axioms (Matroid)/Definition 1|formulation 1]] of the [[Axiom:Rank Axioms (Matroid)|rank axioms]]:"
  ],
  [
   "P20",
   "{{begin-axiom}}"
  ],
  [
   "P21",
   "{{axiom | n = \\text R 1"
  ],
  [
   "P22",
   "        | mr= \\map \\rho \\O = 0"
  ],
  [
   "P23",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P24",
   "{{axiom | n = \\text R 2"
  ],
  [
   "P25",
   "        | q = \\forall X \\in \\powerset S \\land y \\in S"
  ],
  [
   "P26",
   "        | mr= \\map \\rho X \\le \\map \\rho {X \\cup \\set y} \\le \\map \\rho X + 1"
  ],
  [
   "P27",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P28",
   "{{axiom | n = \\text R 3"
  ],
  [
   "P29",
   "        | q = \\forall X \\in \\powerset S \\land y, z \\in S"
  ],
  [
   "P30",
   "        | mr= \\map \\rho {X \\cup \\set y} = \\map \\rho {X \\cup \\set z} = \\map \\rho X \\implies \\map \\rho {X \\cup \\set y \\cup \\set z} = \\map \\rho X"
  ],
  [
   "P31",
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   "P32",
   "{{end-axiom}}"
  ],
  [
